{title: Ye Servants of God}
{artist: Charles Wesley}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 96}

Verse 1
Ye [G]servants of [D]God, your [G]Master pro[C]claim, and [G]publish a[D]broad his [A]wonderful [D]name;
the [G]name all-vic[D]torious of [G]Jesus ex[C]tol — his [G]kingdom is [C]glorious and [D]rules over [G]all.
